      candle: `<svg viewBox="0 0 8 8" class="pixel-icon icon-candle"><rect x="3" y="0" width="2" height="1" fill="var(--accent-gold-glow)"/><rect x="3" y="1" width="2" height="1" fill="var(--accent-gold)"/><rect x="2" y="2" width="4" height="5"/><rect x="3" y="3" width="2" height="1" fill="#fff" opacity="0.7"/><rect x="1" y="7" width="6" height="1" fill="var(--border-color)"/></svg>`,
      
